 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? Once upon time, in a forest far away, there was a big tree with a cabin under its branches. In that cabin lived a kind old woman who loved to tell stories. The tree was haunted, but not by a ghost. A kindly spirit lived there too, watching over the woods. One night, a brave little girl and her brother found the cabin while they were lost in the woods. Sure. Why did the tree never get any work done? Ha, that's a good one.",
